This directrory includes the RTL codes for the implementation of the KUPYNA hash function in the kupyna_misc.sv file considering its all possible realizations under the code length. 
For the tapeout, we consider the following modules, where the reset signal is assumed to be active low and asynchronous.

Architecture  Module                         Description
------------  -----------------------------  ------------------------------------------------------------------------
Serial        kupyna_hash_serial_reuse       Serial with a single round in one clk cycle reusing the XOR transformation                    
Serial        kupyna_hash_serial64b_reuse    Serial with a single column in state matrix in one clock cycle reusing the XOR transformation 
